{"schema_version":2,"level":"C1","level_card_count":33,"updated_at":"2026-08-14","cards":[{"card_id":"b1-009","lemma":"Gewährleistung","display_de":"die Gewährleistung","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["shopping","買い物"],"scene_tags":["shopping"],"japanese":"法定の契約不適合責任・保証","example_de":"Für den Mangel gilt die gesetzliche Gewährleistung.","example_ja":"その不具合には法定の契約不適合責任が適用されます。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Gewährleistungen"},"collocations":["gesetzliche Gewährleistung","Ansprüche aus Gewährleistung"],"learning_note":"任意のメーカー保証 Garantie と、販売者の法的責任 Gewährleistung は別です。","related_terms":["die Garantie","der Mangel"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b1-039","lemma":"Mietminderung","display_de":"die Mietminderung","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["housing"],"japanese":"家賃減額","example_de":"Eine Mietminderung sollte nicht ohne rechtliche Prüfung erfolgen.","example_ja":"家賃減額は法的確認なしに行うべきではありません。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Mietminderungen"},"collocations":["eine Mietminderung prüfen","zur Mietminderung berechtigen"],"learning_note":"不具合があっても自己判断で減額せず、専門家に確認する表現と一緒に覚えます。","related_terms":["der Mangel","die Rechtsberatung"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-008","lemma":"Nacherfüllung","display_de":"die Nacherfüllung","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["shopping","買い物"],"scene_tags":["shopping"],"japanese":"追完（修理または代替品提供）","example_de":"Ich bitte zunächst um Nacherfüllung innerhalb einer angemessenen Frist.","example_ja":"まず相当な期限内の追完を求めます。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Nacherfüllungen"},"collocations":["Nacherfüllung verlangen","eine Frist zur Nacherfüllung setzen"],"learning_note":"不具合の解決として修理や交換を求める法的・実務的な語です。","related_terms":["die Nachbesserung","die Ersatzlieferung"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-009","lemma":"Sachmangel","display_de":"der Sachmangel","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["shopping","買い物","housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["shopping","housing"],"japanese":"商品の契約不適合・物の欠陥","example_de":"Der Defekt stellt einen Sachmangel dar.","example_ja":"その故障は商品の契約不適合に当たります。","grammar":{"article":"der","plural":"Sachmängel"},"collocations":["ein Sachmangel liegt vor","für Sachmängel haften"],"learning_note":"日常語 Mangel より、契約上の物の欠陥を明確にする語です。","related_terms":["der Mangel","die Gewährleistung"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-010","lemma":"vom Vertrag zurücktreten","display_de":"vom Vertrag zurücktreten","unit_type":"collocation","part_of_speech":"phrase","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["shopping","買い物","housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["shopping","housing"],"japanese":"契約を解除する","example_de":"Sollte die Nacherfüllung scheitern, behalte ich mir vor, vom Vertrag zurückzutreten.","example_ja":"追完が失敗した場合、契約解除の権利を留保します。","grammar":{"usage":"von + Dativ zurücktreten。完了形 ist zurückgetreten。"},"collocations":["wirksam vom Vertrag zurücktreten","den Rücktritt erklären"],"learning_note":"単なる Kündigung と異なり、契約を解消する法的効果を示します。","related_terms":["der Rücktritt","widerrufen"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-013","lemma":"Beweislast","display_de":"die Beweislast","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["shopping","買い物"],"scene_tags":["shopping"],"japanese":"立証責任","example_de":"Wer die Beweislast trägt, hängt vom Zeitpunkt des Mangels ab.","example_ja":"誰が立証責任を負うかは、不具合が生じた時期によります。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"通常は単数形"},"collocations":["die Beweislast tragen","Umkehr der Beweislast"],"learning_note":"法的評価が必要な語なので、具体的な案件では専門窓口へ確認します。","related_terms":["der Beweis","nachweisen"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-015","lemma":"Ersatzanspruch","display_de":"der Ersatzanspruch","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["shopping","買い物"],"scene_tags":["shopping"],"japanese":"補償・代替を求める権利","example_de":"Ob ein Ersatzanspruch besteht, muss im Einzelfall geprüft werden.","example_ja":"補償請求権があるかは個別に確認する必要があります。","grammar":{"article":"der","plural":"Ersatzansprüche"},"collocations":["einen Ersatzanspruch prüfen","Ansprüche geltend machen"],"learning_note":"権利があると断定せず、個別確認が必要だと伝える文脈で使います。","related_terms":["der Anspruch","der Schadensersatz"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-016","lemma":"Ermessensentscheidung","display_de":"die Ermessensentscheidung","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["administration","外国人局・役所"],"scene_tags":["administration"],"japanese":"裁量判断","example_de":"Die Behörde muss ihre Ermessensentscheidung nachvollziehbar begründen.","example_ja":"当局は裁量判断を理解できる形で理由付けする必要があります。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Ermessensentscheidungen"},"collocations":["Ermessen ausüben","eine Entscheidung begründen"],"learning_note":"自動的に決まるのではなく、法の範囲で判断の余地がある場面を示します。","related_terms":["das Ermessen","die Begründung"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-017","lemma":"Rechtsbehelfsbelehrung","display_de":"die Rechtsbehelfsbelehrung","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["administration","外国人局・役所"],"scene_tags":["administration"],"japanese":"不服申立て方法の案内","example_de":"Die Rechtsbehelfsbelehrung finden Sie am Ende des Bescheids.","example_ja":"不服申立て方法の案内は決定通知の末尾にあります。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Rechtsbehelfsbelehrungen"},"collocations":["die Rechtsbehelfsbelehrung prüfen","am Ende des Bescheids"],"learning_note":"申立て先・形式・期限が記載されるため、Bescheid と一緒に確認します。","related_terms":["der Rechtsbehelf","der Widerspruch"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-018","lemma":"Mitwirkungspflicht","display_de":"die Mitwirkungspflicht","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["administration","外国人局・役所"],"scene_tags":["administration"],"japanese":"手続きへの協力義務","example_de":"Die Mitwirkungspflicht umfasst die rechtzeitige Vorlage der Unterlagen.","example_ja":"協力義務には書類の期限内提出が含まれます。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Mitwirkungspflichten"},"collocations":["eine Mitwirkungspflicht erfüllen","gegen Mitwirkungspflichten verstoßen"],"learning_note":"必要な情報・書類の提出など、申請者側の協力を指します。","related_terms":["mitwirken","die Pflicht"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-019","lemma":"fristwahrend","display_de":"fristwahrend","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"adjective","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["administration","外国人局・役所"],"scene_tags":["administration"],"japanese":"期限を守る効力のある","example_de":"Zur Fristwahrung reiche ich den Widerspruch zunächst ohne Begründung ein.","example_ja":"期限を守るため、まず理由書なしで異議申立てを提出します。","grammar":{"usage":"形容詞・副詞。zur Fristwahrung という名詞句でもよく使う。"},"collocations":["fristwahrend einreichen","zur Fristwahrung"],"learning_note":"実際に理由の後日提出が可能かは案内や専門家へ確認します。","related_terms":["fristgerecht","die Frist"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-021","lemma":"Sachstandsanfrage","display_de":"die Sachstandsanfrage","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["administration","外国人局・役所"],"scene_tags":["administration"],"japanese":"案件の進捗照会","example_de":"Nach drei Monaten habe ich eine höfliche Sachstandsanfrage geschickt.","example_ja":"3か月後、丁寧な進捗照会を送りました。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Sachstandsanfragen"},"collocations":["eine Sachstandsanfrage stellen","schriftlich nach dem Sachstand fragen"],"learning_note":"催促と断定せず、現在の状況と不足事項を丁寧に確認する文面に向きます。","related_terms":["der Sachstand","der Bearbeitungsstand"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-023","lemma":"Härtefall","display_de":"der Härtefall","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["administration","外国人局・役所","housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["administration","housing"],"japanese":"例外的配慮を要する困難事例","example_de":"Ob ein Härtefall vorliegt, wird anhand der persönlichen Umstände geprüft.","example_ja":"困難事例に当たるかは個別事情に基づいて審査されます。","grammar":{"article":"der","plural":"Härtefälle"},"collocations":["einen Härtefall geltend machen","besondere Härte"],"learning_note":"単に困っているという意味ではなく、制度上の例外要件に関わる語です。","related_terms":["die Ausnahme","die Umstände"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-024","lemma":"Akteneinsicht","display_de":"die Akteneinsicht","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["administration","外国人局・役所"],"scene_tags":["administration"],"japanese":"記録・事件簿の閲覧","example_de":"Ich bitte um Auskunft, wie ich Akteneinsicht beantragen kann.","example_ja":"記録閲覧をどのように申請できるか教えてください。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"通常は単数形"},"collocations":["Akteneinsicht beantragen","Akteneinsicht gewähren"],"learning_note":"閲覧範囲や手続きは案件により異なるため、方法を確認します。","related_terms":["die Akte","Einsicht nehmen"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-027","lemma":"Aufklärungsgespräch","display_de":"das Aufklärungsgespräch","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["medical","病院・薬局"],"scene_tags":["medical"],"japanese":"治療・処置前の説明面談","example_de":"Vor dem Eingriff findet ein ausführliches Aufklärungsgespräch statt.","example_ja":"処置前に詳しい説明面談があります。","grammar":{"article":"das","plural":"Aufklärungsgespräche"},"collocations":["ein Aufklärungsgespräch führen","über Risiken aufklären"],"learning_note":"目的・代替手段・リスクを理解し、質問するための面談です。","related_terms":["die Einwilligung","der Eingriff"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-028","lemma":"Nutzen-Risiko-Abwägung","display_de":"die Nutzen-Risiko-Abwägung","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["medical","病院・薬局"],"scene_tags":["medical"],"japanese":"利益とリスクの比較検討","example_de":"Die Entscheidung beruht auf einer individuellen Nutzen-Risiko-Abwägung.","example_ja":"その判断は個別の利益・リスク評価に基づきます。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Nutzen-Risiko-Abwägungen"},"collocations":["eine Abwägung vornehmen","Nutzen und Risiken abwägen"],"learning_note":"医療者へ利点と不利益を分けて尋ねるときに役立つ語です。","related_terms":["abwägen","das Risiko"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-033","lemma":"Staffelmiete","display_de":"die Staffelmiete","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["housing"],"japanese":"段階的に増額する家賃方式","example_de":"Im Vertrag ist eine jährliche Erhöhung als Staffelmiete vereinbart.","example_ja":"契約では段階家賃として毎年の増額が定められています。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Staffelmieten"},"collocations":["eine Staffelmiete vereinbaren","jährliche Mietstaffel"],"learning_note":"増額時期と金額が契約にあらかじめ示される方式です。","related_terms":["die Indexmiete","die Mieterhöhung"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-034","lemma":"Schönheitsreparaturen","display_de":"die Schönheitsreparaturen","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["housing"],"japanese":"室内の表面的な修繕・模様替え","example_de":"Die Klausel zu Schönheitsreparaturen sollte sorgfältig geprüft werden.","example_ja":"室内修繕に関する条項は慎重に確認すべきです。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"複数形で使用"},"collocations":["Schönheitsreparaturen durchführen","eine Klausel prüfen"],"learning_note":"名称に反して美観だけでなく塗装などを指し、契約条項の有効性は個別確認が必要です。","related_terms":["renovieren","die Vertragsklausel"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-035","lemma":"Eigenbedarfskündigung","display_de":"die Eigenbedarfskündigung","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["housing"],"japanese":"貸主側の自己使用を理由とする解約通知","example_de":"Die Eigenbedarfskündigung muss konkret begründet werden.","example_ja":"自己使用を理由とする解約通知には具体的な理由が必要です。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Eigenbedarfskündigungen"},"collocations":["wegen Eigenbedarfs kündigen","eine Kündigung prüfen lassen"],"learning_note":"法的要件や期限は事案ごとに異なるため、専門家へ確認します。","related_terms":["der Eigenbedarf","die Kündigung"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-036","lemma":"Mängelanzeige","display_de":"die Mängelanzeige","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["housing"],"japanese":"不具合の通知","example_de":"Die Mängelanzeige sollte den Schaden und das Datum genau beschreiben.","example_ja":"不具合通知には損傷と日付を正確に記載すべきです。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Mängelanzeigen"},"collocations":["eine Mängelanzeige senden","den Mangel dokumentieren"],"learning_note":"写真・発生日・影響・連絡履歴を分けて記録すると明確です。","related_terms":["der Mangel","die Schadensmeldung"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-037","lemma":"Hausfriedensstörung","display_de":"die Hausfriedensstörung","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["housing"],"japanese":"共同生活の平穏を乱す行為","example_de":"Wiederholte nächtliche Ruhestörungen können eine Hausfriedensstörung darstellen.","example_ja":"夜間の騒音が繰り返されると、共同生活の平穏を乱す行為に当たり得ます。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Hausfriedensstörungen"},"collocations":["eine Störung dokumentieren","wiederholte Ruhestörung"],"learning_note":"単発の生活音と断定せず、日時・継続・影響を具体的に記録します。","related_terms":["die Ruhestörung","der Hausfrieden"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-039","lemma":"Nebenkostenvorauszahlung","display_de":"die Nebenkostenvorauszahlung","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["housing"],"japanese":"共益費の前払い額","example_de":"Die Nebenkostenvorauszahlung wurde nach der Jahresabrechnung angepasst.","example_ja":"共益費の前払い額は年次精算後に調整されました。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Nebenkostenvorauszahlungen"},"collocations":["die Vorauszahlung anpassen","monatliche Vorauszahlung"],"learning_note":"確定費用ではなく、後で精算される毎月の前払いです。","related_terms":["die Betriebskostenabrechnung","die Nachzahlung"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-041","lemma":"Nachteilsausgleich","display_de":"der Nachteilsausgleich","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["kita-school","Kita・学校"],"scene_tags":["kita-school"],"japanese":"不利益を補う合理的配慮","example_de":"Für den Nachteilsausgleich ist ein schriftlicher Antrag erforderlich.","example_ja":"合理的配慮には書面での申請が必要です。","grammar":{"article":"der","plural":"Nachteilsausgleiche"},"collocations":["einen Nachteilsausgleich beantragen","individueller Nachteilsausgleich"],"learning_note":"学習目標を下げることとは限らず、条件を公平にするための調整を指します。","related_terms":["die Förderung","die Barrierefreiheit"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b2-043","lemma":"Eingliederungshilfe","display_de":"die Eingliederungshilfe","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["kita-school","Kita・学校","administration","外国人