"collocations":["die öffentliche Wahrnehmung","die Wahrnehmung beeinflussen"],"learning_note":"身体的な『知覚』にも、社会的な『受け止め方・認識』にも使われます。","related_terms":["wahrnehmen","die Einschätzung"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"c2-004","lemma":"etwas auf den Prüfstand stellen","display_de":"etwas auf den Prüfstand stellen","unit_type":"collocation","part_of_speech":"phrase","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["work","仕事"],"scene_tags":["work"],"japanese":"〜を根本から検証し直す","example_de":"Nach dem Vorfall wurden sämtliche Kontrollprozesse auf den Prüfstand gestellt.","example_ja":"その出来事を受け、すべての管理プロセスが根本から再検証されました。","grammar":{"usage":"etwas (Akkusativ) auf den Prüfstand stellen。制度・前提・手順を批判的に再検討する表現です。"},"collocations":["eine Strategie auf den Prüfstand stellen"],"learning_note":"単なる確認よりも、変更の可能性を含む厳密な見直しを表します。","related_terms":["überprüfen","hinterfragen"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"c2-005","lemma":"Trugschluss","display_de":"der Trugschluss","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"C1","level_tags":["C1"],"topic_tags":["work","仕事"],"scene_tags":["work"],"japanese":"誤った推論、思い違い","example_de":"Es wäre ein Trugschluss, aus der Korrelation unmittelbar auf eine Ursache zu schließen.","example_ja":"相関関係から直ちに原因を推論するのは誤りです。","grammar":{"article":"der","plural":"Trugschlüsse"},"collocations":["einem Trugschluss erliegen","ein logischer Trugschluss"],"learning_note":"単なる事実誤認ではなく、推論の過程に誤りがあることを指します。","related_terms":["der Irrtum","der Fehlschluss"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-co