":"留保付きで、暫定的に","example_de":"Ich kann dem Vorschlag nur unter Vorbehalt zustimmen.","example_ja":"その提案には留保付きでしか同意できません。","grammar":{"usage":"最終確認や条件の充足までは確定しないことを示します。"},"collocations":["unter Vorbehalt zustimmen","vorbehaltlich der Prüfung"],"learning_note":"同意や承認が無条件・最終的ではないことを明確にします。","related_terms":["vorläufig","vorbehaltlich"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"}]}
